---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Legal Notice, Privacy Policy & Security Audit Charter • Aegis" 
  description="Legal notice of AIVO SASU, GDPR privacy policy, French Criminal Code Article 323-1 compliance, and ethical terms of service for the Aegis security scanner."
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-slate-200 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
        <span>⚖️</span>
        <span>LEGAL FRAMEWORK, GDPR &amp; ETHICAL AUDIT CHARTER</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Legal Notice &amp; Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2 font-mono">
        Last updated: November 4, 2026 • Aegis Platform operated by AIVO SASU
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- In-page anchor navigation -->
    <div class="mb-10 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
      <span class="text-slate-500 font-bold">Quick navigation:</span>
      <a href="#legal-notice" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">1. Legal Notice</a>
      <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
      <a href="#hosting" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">2. Hosting &amp; Sovereignty</a>
      <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
      <a href="#audit-charter" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">3. Audit Charter &amp; Legal Compliance</a>
      <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
      <a href="#gdpr" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">4. Data Privacy (GDPR)</a>
      <span class="text-slate-700">•</span>
      <a href="#open-core" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">5. Open-Core &amp; Disclaimer</a>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">

      <!-- SECTION 1 -->
      <section id="legal-notice" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">01.</span>
          <span>Legal Notice &amp; Publisher Information</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          The website and sovereign diagnostic platform accessible at <strong class="text-white">aegis.aivo.fr</strong> (along with associated subdomains) are owned, published, and operated by:
        </p>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <div><strong class="text-white">Company Name:</strong> AIVO SASU</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Legal Form:</strong> Simplified Joint-Stock Corporation with a Single Shareholder (SASU) with a share capital of €1.00</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Registration:</strong> Paris Trade and Companies Register (RCS) under number <strong>100 065 978</strong></div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Registered Office:</strong> 9 Rue des Colonnes, 75002 Paris, France</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Publication Director:</strong> Nicolas BAUD (President)</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Contact Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@aivo.fr" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">contact@aivo.fr</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 2 -->
      <section id="hosting" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">02.</span>
          <span>Hosting &amp; Sovereign Data Residence</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          The Aegis platform strictly complies with sovereign data governance principles, offering native immunity against foreign extraterritorial regulations (including the <em>US CLOUD Act</em> and FISA Section 702).
        </p>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 font-mono text-xs space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <div><strong class="text-white">Primary Cloud Hosting:</strong> OVH SAS</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Host Address:</strong> 2 Rue Kellermann, 59100 Roubaix, France</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Telephone:</strong> 1007 (or +33 9 72 10 10 07)</div>
          <div><strong class="text-white">Server &amp; Backup Locations:</strong> Exclusively situated in mainland France data centers (Gravelines / Roubaix).</div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          All diagnostics and telemetry data are transmitted exclusively through encrypted TLS 1.3 tunnels on infrastructure governed solely by European Union regulations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 3 -->
      <section id="audit-charter" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">03.</span>
          <span>Ethical Audit Charter &amp; Legal Compliance (Article 323-1 French Criminal Code)</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs">
          <strong>⚠️ Imperative Legal Notice:</strong> Unauthorized access to computer systems constitutes a criminal offense under French law. Usage of the Aegis scanner is strictly regulated.
        </div>
        
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mt-4">A. Passive Diagnostic (Level 1)</h3>
        <p>
          The Level 1 diagnostic operates in a <strong>strictly passive and non-intrusive</strong> manner. It gathers only public, publicly advertised data over HTTP/HTTPS (X.509 certificates, HTTP security headers, public EcoIndex metrics, and known CVE version correlations). It does not perform penetration testing, exploit payloads, or data tampering.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mt-4">B. In-Depth Diagnostic (Level 2) &amp; Legal Mandate</h3>
        <p>
          Article 323-1 of the French Criminal Code provides that:
        </p>
        <blockquote class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border-l-4 border-emerald-400 italic text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs">
          "The act of fraudulently accessing or remaining within all or part of an automated data processing system is punishable by three years' imprisonment and a fine of €100,000. Where this results in the deletion or alteration of data, or disruption of system operations, the penalty is increased to five years' imprisonment and a fine of €150,000."
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          To ensure strict adherence to international computer crime regulations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>DNS Challenge Ownership Verification:</strong> Active probes for sensitive configuration endpoints (<code class="text-emerald-300 font-mono">/.env</code>, <code class="text-emerald-300 font-mono">/.git/config</code>) are <strong>technically gated</strong> until the domain owner proves legitimate control by inserting a unique DNS TXT verification token (<code class="text-emerald-300 font-mono">aegis-site-verification=...</code>).</li>
          <li><strong>Sealed Electronic Audit Mandate:</strong> The operator must expressly authorize AIVO SASU by certifying ownership. This declaration is cryptographically hashed (SHA-256 fingerprint, signer IP address, and RFC 3339 UTC timestamp).</li>
          <li><strong>User Liability:</strong> The user warrants that they are the legitimate owner or possess formal written authorization to conduct security diagnostics on the target scope. AIVO SASU disclaims any liability resulting from fraudulent claims and will cooperate fully with law enforcement.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 4 -->
      <section id="gdpr" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">04.</span>
          <span>Privacy Policy &amp; Data Protection (GDPR)</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2016/679 - GDPR):
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">🎯 Collected Data</div>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-300 space-y-1">
              <li>Connection IP addresses (technical security logs and rate-limiting).</li>
              <li>Scanned domain names and associated public metadata.</li>
              <li>Business email and company name (only upon explicit request for Level 2 verification or commercial consulting).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">⏱️ Retention Periods</div>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-300 space-y-1">
              <li>Anonymous passive scans: <strong>30 days</strong>, followed by automated purging.</li>
              <li>Signed Level 2 audit mandates: <strong>3 years</strong> (statutory legal evidence).</li>
              <li>Commercial prospect inquiries: <strong>3 years</strong> from the last active interaction.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mt-4">Cookie &amp; Tracking Policy</h3>
        <p>
          Aegis enforces a strict zero-surveillance design:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Zero advertising trackers:</strong> No third-party tracking scripts (Google Analytics, Meta Pixel) are embedded.</li>
          <li><strong>Strictly essential technical cookies:</strong> Only the secure session cookie <code class="text-emerald-300 font-mono">__Host-aegis_session</code> (Pure BFF mode, HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Secure) and local theme preference (<code class="text-emerald-300 font-mono">aegis_theme</code>) are utilized. These are exempt from consent under EU ePrivacy guidelines.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mt-4">Exercising Your Rights</h3>
        <p>
          You hold the right to access, rectify, delete, and restrict processing of your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact our Data Protection Officer at:
          <a href="mailto:contact@aivo.fr" class="text-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold hover:underline">contact@aivo.fr</a>. 
          You also have the right to lodge a complaint with your supervisory authority (in France, the <a href="https://www.cnil.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">CNIL</a>).
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 5 -->
      <section id="open-core" class="space-y-4 scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
          <span class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm">05.</span>
          <span>Open-Core Licensing, Intellectual Property &amp; Disclaimer</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Aegis is developed under an <strong>Ethical Open-Core Model</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>AGPLv3 License:</strong> The community core engine, Go/Rust Ingress/Egress proxies, and hardware RAPL probes are licensed under the <em>GNU Affero General Public License v3.0</em>.</li>
          <li><strong>Advisory Nature of Diagnostics:</strong> Vulnerability scores, carbon footprint calculations (EcoIndex v3), and generated reports are advisory diagnostic tools. They do not constitute an official guarantee of invulnerability or a certified regulatory security audit.</li>
          <li><strong>Limitation of Liability:</strong> AIVO SASU shall not be held liable for any direct or indirect damages resulting from the implementation or non-implementation of security recommendations produced by the platform.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer link back -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
      <a href="/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>←</span>
        <span>Back to Aegis Homepage</span>
      </a>
      <span class="text-slate-500">
        © 2026 AIVO SASU • All rights reserved
      </span>
    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
